.................... ////         data that either fit the boot protocol or HID protocol.   //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// May 6th, 2003: Fixed a potential stack overflow using PCM         //// 
.................... ////                                                                   //// 
.................... //// October 29th, 2002: New definition added to USB_STATES            //// 
